      "value": "@{5f2def4d22470972dc58f6a2|full_name}: I still don't fully understand... Is it where the feet get pushed into the ground for a second before transitioning from Stand to Crouch? I know when Upright is below 0.6~ it disables feet IK, which *i wish was an option*.\nAnd the times I've tried using auto footsteps off, it locks my hips in the direction I was last moving, so haven't bothered with it.",
